  "prefLabel": "Lot 7303.04 Subpoenas",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7303.04 Subpoenas.\n\n(a) In accordance with RSA 287-D:25, the commission shall issue subpoenas for witnesses and for documents relative to investigations by the commission pursuant to (b) below.\n\n(b) The commission shall issue a subpoena for the attendance of witnesses or the production of evidence upon a showing that:\n\n(1) The testimony or evidence is necessary, relevant, and non-repetitive; and\n\n(2) The witness or evidence cannot be voluntarily obtained.\n\nSource. #13179, eff 3-19-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7300.html"
